  apply hmajor.mono' hmeas.aestronglyMeasurable
  filter_upwards [] with q
  rcases q with ⟨⟨⟨x, y⟩, p⟩, r⟩
  change ‖scratch_ModelCenterTranslationIntegrand α u F t (((x, y), p), r)‖ ≤
