            |F 3 (modelPoint (x 0) (x 1) (y 2))|) * |F 0 x| *
          ((|modelPhiAt (t ^ α.weight 0)
              (t ^ α.weight 0 * u 0) (x 0 - p 0)| *
            |modelPhiAt (t ^ α.weight 1)
